{"id":"124410","t":{"th":"สะดุดรักยัยแฟนเช่า ซีซัน 2","ro":"Kanojo, Okarishimasu 2nd Season","en":"Rent-a-Girlfriend Season 2","na":"彼女、お借りします 第2期","thShared":true},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx124410-iScdHzzEqdmk.png","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx124410-iScdHzzEqdmk.png","color":"#f1d650","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/124410-mo2jQSOaJIeL.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":12,"dur":24,"season":"SUMMER","year":2022,"start":"2022-07-02","country":"JP","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"score":64,"pop":138993,"studio":"TMS Entertainment","desc":"A hopeless college student, Kazuya Kinoshita, meets a graceful rental girlfriend, Chizuru Ichinose, and ends up introducing her as\nhis girlfriend to his family and friends. Time goes on with Kazuya unable to tell the truth, as he's surrounded by devilish ex-girlfriend Mami Nanami, who keeps coming back to tempt him for some reason, hyper-aggressive provisional girlfriend Ruka Sarashina, who doesn't know how to take no for an answer, and super shy but diligent and hardworking younger rental girlfriend, Sumi Sakurasawa… beautiful girlfriends of all types! The pub, the beach, hot springs, Christmas, and New Year’s… Having gone through these challenging events, Kazuya's feelings for Chizuru keep growing stronger. But she reveals a shocking truth that threatens to shake their \"relationship\" to the very core!","descTh":"คาซึยะ คิโนชิตะ นักศึกษาวิทยาลัยผู้สิ้นหวัง ได้พบกับอิจิโนเสะ จิซึรุ แฟนสาวเช่าสุดสง่างาม และจบลงด้วยการแนะนำเธอว่า\nแฟนสาวของเขากับครอบครัวและเพื่อนของเขา เวลาผ่านไปโดยที่ Kazuya ไม่สามารถบอกความจริงได้ ในขณะที่เขาถูกรายล้อมไปด้วย Mami Nanami อดีตแฟนสาวผู้ชั่วร้ายซึ่งกลับมาล่อลวงเขาด้วยเหตุผลบางอย่าง Ruka Sarashina แฟนสาวชั่วคราวที่ก้าวร้าวเกินเหตุซึ่งไม่รู้ว่าจะปฏิเสธคำตอบได้อย่างไร และ Sumi Sakurasawa แฟนสาวเช่าที่ขี้อายแต่ขยันและทำงานหนักสุด ๆ… แฟนสาวแสนสวยทุกประเภท! ผับ ชายหาด น้ำพุร้อน คริสต์มาส และปีใหม่... หลังจากผ่านเหตุการณ์ที่ท้าทายเหล่านี้มา ความรู้สึกของคาซึยะที่มีต่อจิซึรุก็แข็งแกร่งขึ้นเรื่อยๆ แต่เธอกลับเผยความจริงอันน่าตกตะลึงที่อาจจะทำให้ \"ความสัมพันธ์\" ของพวกเขาสั่นคลอนจนถึงแก่นแท้!","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":null,"descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"Q0KAQ7_YNEk","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/124410","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/42963","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"muse_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLF_OYMz95-fM","lang":"dub","eps":[["9","y:tGUZmASh0Uk",1792058876,"~",null,"21",{"d":1468,"sk":[[100.9,189.1],[1347.5,1457.2]]}],["10","y:9PYKe_ZqiUc",1792058876,"~",null,"22",{"d":1468,"sk":[[135.0,223.1],[1132.5,1220.6]]}],["11","y:E15GCGO1Bcc",1792058876,"~",null,"23",{"d":1468,"sk":[[172.9,261.1],[1347.5,1457.2]]}],["12","y:oEuUNfq65z4",1792058876,"~",null,"24",{"d":1438,"sk":[[1210.1,1298.2]],"fin":1}],["2","y:wWZ7qlIhwl4",1791454076,"~",null,"14",{"d":1468,"sk":[[38.0,126.1],[1307.4,1395.5]]}],["3","y:Pc6SDWtzkKU",1791454076,"~",null,"15",{"d":1468,"sk":[[45.0,133.1],[1193.2,1271.4]]}],["4","y:tI9IjbsxZ78",1791454076,"~",null,"16",{"d":1468,"sk":[[24.0,112.1],[1318.5,1406.5]]}],["5","y:oq77asYxoIA",1791454076,"~",null,"17",{"d":1468,"sk":[[107.9,197.0],[1338.4,1426.5]]}],["6","y:wi72yNAKS2I",1791454076,"~",null,"18",{"d":1468,"sk":[[171.0,260.1],[1347.5,1435.0]]}],["7","y:x_gY3qg0ecQ",1791454076,"~",null,"19",{"d":1468,"sk":[[283.0,371.1],[1282.4,1370.5]]}],["8","y:lFa3lsDIeqQ",1791454076,"~",null,"20",{"d":1468,"sk":[[198.9,287.0]]}],["1","y:Pfpun3BxEIE",1790849276,"~",null,"13",{"d":1468,"sk":[[165.0,253.1]]}]]},{"p":"muse_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLIa05JMgYhha0IOBtjb6obge_y6etfc2Q","lang":"sub","eps":[["1","y:R1_Lp-S8aGU",1667200881,"~",null,"13",{"d":1468,"sk":[[164.9,253.1]]}],["2","y:XzPp3m6xz_I",1667200881,"~",null,"14",{"d":1468,"sk":[[37.9,126.1],[1307.4,1395.5]]}],["3","y:i535ArjmACU",1667200881,"~",null,"15",{"d":1468,"sk":[[44.9,133.1],[